00:21:22.936 --> 00:21:24.662
Pass, no pass,
when to take a piss.


00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.423
I know, Dad.


00:21:26.561 --> 00:21:29.598
All right.
Just so you understand.


00:21:29.736 --> 00:21:31.359
It’s a contract.


00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:33.982
Where’s the...


00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.604
On the table.


