00:26:19.198 --> 00:26:20.786
JERRY:
Attaboy.


00:26:24.997 --> 00:26:27.275
Oh, man. Not too bad.


00:26:27.413 --> 00:26:30.899
I’d say you’re a natural.
[chuckles]


00:26:31.037 --> 00:26:33.453
Next time,
